{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cursedland! It's a blood-pumping, action-filled platformer experience bursting to the brim with humor, chaos, and memes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursedland is a 2D indie action platformer that combines extreme precision, absurd humor, and constant chaos. Designed for players who enjoy challenging platform games, Cursedland blends classic mechanics with a modern approach and a strong, distinctive identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cursedland, every jump matters. You will navigate floating platforms, avoid deadly traps, and fight eccentric enemies as you progress through a surreal world filled with humorous references and unpredictable situations. The game tests your reflexes, movement control, and ability to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to escape the cursed kingdom of Cursedland, using precision, strategy, and fast reflexes while protecting a mysterious mask that shields you from the corrupting power that dominates this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES OF CURSEDLAND:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D action platformer that combines speed, precision, and absurd humor into an intense and rewarding experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement counts: level design focused on precision, rhythm, and mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable levels in this demo, packed with challenging obstacles that will test your skill and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and unique enemies, each with attack patterns you must learn to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired art style with a modern twist, blending nostalgic visuals with an extravagant presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but demanding controls, centered around movement mastery and strategic play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursedland is ideal for fans of hard platformer games, indie action games, and experiences where skill, challenge, and humor go hand in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/4f514ac392a3a7da37278360d20d4969.avif?t=1770980893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras_big/4f514ac392a3a7da37278360d20d4969.avif?t=1770980893 width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/699e40b1be5d81202b148f67bbb76fac.avif?t=1770980893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras_big/699e40b1be5d81202b148f67bbb76fac.avif?t=1770980893 width=800 height=446 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras/b5291d8308e2823fe05fc48bcccf0a62.avif?t=1770980893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447170/extras_big/b5291d8308e2823fe05fc48bcccf0a62.avif?t=1770980893 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start Cursedland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447170/1c6cb610eebf8e37f976db4abe72668463af73a7.jpg"},{"name":"Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447170/ac9153da7388f4627c2515a1e72cef1688daa002.jpg"},{"name":"Field","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447170/f9e96b07f486ecd4881e2ba37fa76d63cd6891a0.jpg"},{"name":"Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447170/275f5fbac1cad08e92bd6dc88dcf3910a66c9a73.jpg"},{"name":"The Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.ste